::  name       rishi env bindings bound gate
::  shape      count - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while a binding count stays within env=512 (count <= 511 before this one); answers 0 past the wall
::  example    300 -> 1 · 900 -> 0
::  readers    Rishi · Glow Tend a1 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e243-rishi-env-gate-v0
::
::  Ashvini a1 · the shell's own wall, decided in Glow — STOA331 grammar.
::  rishi/src/main.rye names max_env_bindings = 512, the ceiling that ended
::  the parity monolith's TooManyBindings. Rye still enforces at runtime;
::  the wall now also speaks.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 511)  0  1
